      - [Project-Status.md](https://Project-Status.md)
      - [Glossary.md](https://Glossary.md)
      - [Core-Values.md](https://Core-Values.md)
      - [Public-and-Private-Work.md](https://Public-and-Private-Work.md)
      - [Resume.md](https://Resume.md)
      - [onboarding/start-here.md](https://start-here.md)
      - [onboarding/start-here.prompt](https://start-here.prompt)
      - [Livedemo.md](https://Livedemo.md)

  seo:
    completed:
      - [index.html](https://index.html)
      - [home.html](https://home.html)
      - [about.html](https://about.html)
      - [resume.html](https://resume.html)
      - [projects/index.html](https://index.html)
      - [projects/ai-continuity.html](https://ai-continuity.html)
      - [projects/symbiosis.html](https://symbiosis.html)
      - [projects/architecture.html](https://architecture.html)
      - [projects/security.html](https://security.html)
      - [projects/experiments.html](https://experiments.html)
      - [projects/documentation.html](https://documentation.html)
      - [projects/skolai.html](https://skolai.html)
      - [projects/digital-voting.html](https://digital-voting.html)
      - [projects/knowledge-architecture.html](https://knowledge-architecture.html)
    seo_elements:
